WEBVTT

00:39:27.817 --> 00:39:30.105
And she was in love with me, too.

00:39:30.129 --> 00:39:32.518
We had just been
very careful with each other.

00:39:32.542 --> 00:39:38.980
So we had an amazing, very romantic,
beautiful, tiny piece of moment together,

00:39:39.004 --> 00:39:40.944
and then she died.

00:39:40.968 --> 00:39:42.847
CA: I mean, Liz, there are probably ...

00:39:42.871 --> 00:39:48.093
you know, some of the many millions
of people who read "Eat Pray Love" --

00:39:48.117 --> 00:39:50.434
they love this perfect ending,

00:39:50.458 --> 00:39:52.199
the happily-ever-after ending,

00:39:52.223 --> 00:39:57.102
and will have been shocked
by what happened, in a way.

00:39:57.126 --> 00:39:59.129
What's your message to them?

00:39:59.153 --> 00:40:01.800
EG: Well, first of all,
I want to say thank you to them,